# The bytes of one /resume: a prompt with an answer, /new, then /resume and
# Enter on the session it left -- where the reset, the replay, the band and
# the window title land against the synchronized update. `wire new` is
# everything up to the picker, so the resume's own bytes are what follows it.
gateway resume-turns.json
wait 4
type first question alpha
wait 0.5
key Enter
wait 4
type /new
wait 0.5
key Enter
wait 2
wire new
type /resume
wait 0.5
key Enter
wait 2
type alpha
wait 0.5
key Enter
wait 3
snap resumed
snapfull resumed
title resumed
wire resumed
